```
$ /home/szf/data/dev/llmke-v2-toolenv/bin/python -c "... sha1(seed)[:15] ..."
seed=table|kb_9|329|0 -> 1137902847478273881  (== doc1 pk)
seed=table|kb_9|333|0 -> 885155839145947657  (== doc2 pk)
